DESCRIPTION:For 2026 payments of $2\,000 or more for services to a contra
 ctor who gave you a Form W-9. January 31\, 2027 is a Sunday\, so the due 
 date moves to Monday\, February 1. Overseas contractors on a W-8BEN who d
 id all the work abroad generally don't get one.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-a
 dvisory.com/blog/hiring-overseas-contractors-taxes-w8ben/\nGeneral inform
